  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in a wok over medium-high heat until almost smoking.",
    "add shallots, garlic, and red chili flakes, and stir-fry for 2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "add fish sauce, lime juice, and coconut sugar, and stir-fry for 1 minute, until sugar dissolves.",
    "push vegetables to one side of the wok.",
    "add beurre-monte to the other side, and stir constantly for 2 minutes, until mixture starts to thicken.",
    "add water, and stir constantly for 2 minutes, until mixture doubles in volume.",
    "add coconut milk, and stir to combine.",
    "return vegetables to the wok, and stir-fry for 1 minute, until heated through.",
    "season with salt, black pepper, and additional fish sauce if needed.",
    "garnish with chopped cilantro, and serve immediately."
  ],
